1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:02,299
(Howard:)Since we all agree
Episode I isn't our favourite,

2
00:00:02,458 --> 00:00:03,728
(Howard:)maybe we just skip it this time.

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:05,892
Yeah, Howard,
I think you of all people

4
00:00:06,061 --> 00:00:07,801
(Sheldon:)should avoid espousing
the principle

5
00:00:07,963 --> 00:00:09,463
(Sheldon:)that if something
is not our favourite,

6
00:00:09,631 --> 00:00:10,841
(Sheldon:)we should just get rid of it.

7
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,740
You know, I heard this way
of watching the movies

8
00:00:16,905 --> 00:00:20,045
(Raj:)called the Machete Order,
where you watch Episodes IV and V,

9
00:00:20,209 --> 00:00:21,879
(Raj:)then skip Episode I,

10
00:00:22,044 --> 00:00:24,184
(Raj:)watch II and III
as a flashback,

11
00:00:24,346 --> 00:00:25,756
(Raj:)and then finish with VI.

12
00:00:25,914 --> 00:00:27,914
OK, so you'd lose
most of Jar Jar,

13
00:00:28,083 --> 00:00:30,753
(Howard:)all the trade route talk,
and the boring senate hearings,

14
00:00:30,919 --> 00:00:33,419
(Howard:)which are like watching C-SPAN
with monsters.

15
00:00:34,923 --> 00:00:38,273
(Sheldon:)Get rid of the trade route part?
Then how would Palpatine

16
00:00:38,427 --> 00:00:41,267
(Sheldon:)get Chancellor Valorum
kicked out of office?

17
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:43,210
(Sheldon:)How would he get
himself elected? How?

18
00:00:43,365 --> 00:00:45,105
(Sheldon:)Can we get through one holiday

19
00:00:45,267 --> 00:00:48,177
(Sheldon:)without you saying
something ridiculous?

20
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:49,680
(Raj:)It was just a suggestion.

21
00:00:49,838 --> 00:00:51,908
(Sheldon:)Well, you know what else
was just a suggestion?

22
00:00:52,074 --> 00:00:54,854
"Why don't we change
the Raisin Bran box?"

23
00:00:54,943 --> 00:00:56,543
(Sheldon:)And you know
who got hurt by that?

24
00:00:56,712 --> 00:01:03,022
(Sheldon:)Every single person
who eats breakfast!

